 542+ C194
 543+ C194 AF               xor a                   ; Black BORDER.
 544+ C195 D3 FE            out ($fe),a             ; Semiciclo NEGATIVO de la onda, BEEPER OFF.
 545+ C197
 546+ C197 08               ex af,af
 547+ C198
 548+ C198 47               ld b,a
 549+ C199
 550+ C199 10 FE        Delay_8 djnz Delay_8
